  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "The cut back is the most dangerous ball in the box, and the least defended.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Wide attackers reach the byline and cut back to a runner on the penalty spot.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 7.34,
   "text": "One defender always drops off their man to own the cut back zone.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 12.58,
   "text": "The others mark near and far post. The cut back gets blocked a stride early.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 20.97,
   "text": "Once that's comfortable, send two attackers to the edge of the box instead of one.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "progression"
  },
  {
